OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fwith clear spells, though more cloud
OL,7,Fin the north or west at times. Chance
OL,8,Fof a few coastal showers, near the
OL,9,Fnorth Norfolk coast overnight. Winds
OL,10,Feasing to become light inland, but
OL,11,Fremaining breezy near the coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FBright and dry through the
OL,14,Fmorning, more cloud developing during
OL,15,Fthe afternoon with scattered showers,
OL,16,Ffurther north, largely dry in the
OL,17,Fsouth. Moderate westerly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
